.TH start-cli-volumes-create-disk 1  "disk "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-volumes\-create\-disk \- Create the volume on an external drive partition
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli volumes create disk\fR [\fB\-\-path\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fILOGICALNAME\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create the volume on an external drive partition
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-path\fR \fI<PATH>\fR [default: /]
Directory on the partition, created if missing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fILOGICALNAME\fR>
Partition device path, e.g. /dev/sdb1
